    <!-- UPDATE DATE / VERSION WITH ANY UPDATES -->
    <p>IPA Sticky Tab Component is nested within an IPAStickyTabSet. The title must be filled up in this component as
      well as the body with the desired content.
      The IPAStickyTabSet will then calculate the correct offset and selection of the floating navigation
    </p>

